        <opt>간접조사</opt>
        <opt>직접조사</opt>
        <opt>원격조사</opt>
      </q>
    </quiz>
  </section>
  <section n="13" title="GPS VS GIS">
    <line>GPS = Global Positioning System =&gt; 위치정보 수집</line>
    <line>GIS = Geographic Information System =&gt; 분석 &amp; 시각화</line>
  </section>
